{
    "title": "Solitaire",
    "description": "Classic Solitaire is a popular card game in the world and loved by many people for a long time. Before, people played Solitaire on their PC, but now you can play Solitaire on your phone, tablet as well as PC.\r\n\r\nSolitaire can make you think and help you to be smart. It is interesting and relaxing, but also challenging. We have a lot of functions to help beginners learn and win, such as Undo, Hint and Deal 1 Card at a time. If you are experienced players and you want some challenges, you can choose to deal 3 cards to enhance the difficulty. \r\n\r\nSolitaire is classic, but never old. Please enjoy our game!\r\n\r\nFeatures:\r\n* Winning Deals: It is winnable, but you still need to find the right ways to beat the challenges.\r\n* Random Deals: Might not be winnable, but you can try to find the solution by yourself. \r\n* Daily Challenge: New challenges are always coming out and this keeps Solitaire new and prevailing.\r\n* Statistics: You can check your statistics anytime in the game and think how to play better.\r\n* Deal 1 or 3 cards: If you think tha game is easy, you can try dealing 3.\r\n* Hint & Undo: These can help beginners to learn and win the game.\r\n\r\nNo need to hesitate. Play Solitaire, solve puzzles and enjoy the game. Also, we value your feedback. Feel free to suggest us. And of course, like and follow us on Facebook: https://www.facebook.com/NeverOldSolitaire",
    "descriptionHTML": "Classic Solitaire is a popular card game in the world and loved by many people for a long time. Before, people played Solitaire on their PC, but now you can play Solitaire on your phone, tablet as well as PC.<br><br>Solitaire can make you think and help you to be smart. It is interesting and relaxing, but also challenging. We have a lot of functions to help beginners learn and win, such as Undo, Hint and Deal 1 Card at a time. If you are experienced players and you want some challenges, you can choose to deal 3 cards to enhance the difficulty. <br><br>Solitaire is classic, but never old. Please enjoy our game!<br><br>Features:<br>* Winning Deals: It is winnable, but you still need to find the right ways to beat the challenges.<br>* Random Deals: Might not be winnable, but you can try to find the solution by yourself. <br>* Daily Challenge: New challenges are always coming out and this keeps Solitaire new and prevailing.<br>* Statistics: You can check your statistics anytime in the game and think how to play better.<br>* Deal 1 or 3 cards: If you think tha game is easy, you can try dealing 3.<br>* Hint &amp; Undo: These can help beginners to learn and win the game.<br><br>No need to hesitate. Play Solitaire, solve puzzles and enjoy the game. Also, we value your feedback. Feel free to suggest us. And of course, like and follow us on Facebook: https://www.facebook.com/NeverOldSolitaire",
